@startuml
participant PO
participant "FastAPI" as F
database "CloudSQL" as C
participant "ArtifactMCP" as A
participant "ReportMCP" as R
participant "GCS" as G
alt retry a completed session or lost response
PO -> F: retry finalization/download (session ID, idempotency key)
F -> C: load completed session + report reference
C --> F: immutable report reference
note over F: generate fresh signed URL; no render or write
F --> PO: final report reference + signed URL (single response)
PO -> G: download with signed URL
G --> PO: report bytes
else finalize active session or retry finalizing session
alt entered from flow 2 gate
note over F: existing turn lock remains held
else retry an existing finalizing session
PO -> F: retry finalization (session ID, idempotency key)
F -> C: load finalizing session + acquire turn lock (lease TTL 6 min)
C --> F: finalizing session + report references
end
F -> C: session -> finalizing (idempotent)
F -> A: save finalized-review artifact (synthesis + dialogue + acceptance)
A --> F: finalized-review reference
F -> R: render each requested format (MD/PDF) from finalized-review
alt reports and download URLs prepared
R -> G: save report artifacts (one per requested format)
G --> R: artifact metadata
R --> F: artifact references
note over F: generate signed URLs from artifact references
F -> C: persist report references + session -> completed
F -> C: release turn lock
F --> PO: final report references + signed URLs (single response)
PO -> G: download with signed URL
G --> PO: report bytes
else report or signed-URL generation fails, or deadline expires
note over F,R: orchestration normalizes failure as structured error
F -> C: keep finalizing + release turn lock
F --> PO: structured retryable error (single response)
end
end
@enduml
